UnitTypeId(GetFilterUnit())=='nfoh' or GetUnitTypeId(GetFilterUnit())=='ndfl' or IsUnitTypeInN0FSet(GetFilterUnit()))and IsUnitDeadOrInvalid(GetFilterUnit())==false and GetUnitAbilityLevel(GetFilterUnit(),'Asud')==0 and IsUnitType(GetFilterUnit(),UNIT_TYPE_HERO)==false and IsUnitAlly(GetFilterUnit(),GetOwningPlayer(FilterReferenceUnitB)) and GetOwningPlayer(GetFilterUnit())!=NeutralPassivePlayer and IsUnitIllusion(GetFilterUnit())==false and IsUnitType(GetFilterUnit(),UNIT_TYPE_FLYING)==false and GetUnitTypeId(GetFilterUnit())!='n0F5' thenset d=DistanceBetweenCoords(EnumParamY,EnumParamAngle,GetUnitX(GetFilterUnit()),GetUnitY(GetFilterUnit()))if d<EnumParamX thenset EnumParamX=dset FilterReferenceUnit_2=GetFilterUnit()endifendifreturn falseendfunctionfunction FilterNearestAlliedStructureAnchor takes nothing returns booleanlocal real dif(GetUnitAbilityLevel(GetFilterUnit(),'A04R')==0 or IsUnitTypeInU00RSet(GetFilterUnit())or GetUnitTypeId(GetFilterUnit())=='nfoh' or GetUnitTypeId(GetFilterUnit())=='ndfl' or IsUnitTypeInN0FSet(GetFilterUnit()))and IsUnitDeadOrInvalid(GetFilterUnit())==false and GetUnitAbilityLevel(GetFilterUnit(),'Asud')==0 and IsUnitType(GetFilterUnit(),UNIT_TYPE_HERO)==false and IsUnitAlly(GetFilterUnit(),GetOwningPlayer(FilterReferenceUnitB)) and GetOwningPlayer(GetFilterUnit())!=NeutralPassivePlayer and IsUnitIllusion(GetFilterUnit())==false and IsUnitType(GetFilterUnit(),UNIT_TYPE_FLYING)==false and GetUnitTypeId(GetFilterUnit())!='n0F5' thenset d=DistanceBetweenCoords(EnumParamY,EnumParamAngle,GetUnitX(GetFilterUnit()),GetUnitY(GetFilterUnit()))if d<EnumParamX and d<325 and IsUnitType(GetFilterUnit(),UNIT_TYPE_STRUCTURE)==true thenset EnumParamX=dset FilterReferenceUnit_2=GetFilterUnit()endifendifreturn falseendfunctionfunction FindTeleportAnchorUnit takes unit sourceUnit,real centerX,real centerY returns unitlocal group searchGroup=AcquireGroupFromPool()set FilterReferenceUnit_2=nullset FilterReferenceUnitB=sourceUnitset