ndexCost900A],GetUnitX(TrackedSideUnit[1]),GetUnitY(TrackedSideUnit[1])),Player(2),false)elsecall GroupClear(UnitCountEnumGroup)call GroupEnumUnitsSelected(UnitCountEnumGroup,Player(1),null)set bj_lastLoadedUnit=FirstOfGroup(UnitCountEnumGroup)set bj_forLoopAIndex=GetPlayerId(GetOwningPlayer(bj_lastLoadedUnit))call DisableTrigger(PerPlayerAiControlTrigger[bj_forLoopAIndex])call DebugPrintGlobal("Attempt Order: "+I2S(commandCode)+" >> "+BoolToTF(IssueTargetOrderById(bj_lastLoadedUnit,commandCode,TrackedSideUnit[2])))call EnableTrigger(PerPlayerAiControlTrigger[bj_forLoopAIndex])endifset unit2=nullset unit7=nullset tempItem=nullset tempGroup=nullendfunctionfunction FilterTriggerUnitOwnedByListenPlayer takes nothing returns booleanreturn(GetOwningPlayer(GetTriggerUnit())==Player(ListenedPlayerId))endfunctionfunction DebugPrintSpellCast takes nothing returns nothingcall DisplayTextToPlayer(FirstPlayingUser,0,0,"SC "+GetUnitName(GetTriggerUnit())+" casted spell "+IntToRawcodeString(GetSpellAbilityId())+" on "+GetUnitName(GetSpellTargetUnit())+" at ("+I2S(R2I(GetSpellTargetX()))+","+I2S(R2I(GetSpellTargetY()))+")")endfunctionfunction DebugPrintIssuedOrder takes nothing returns nothinglocal string messageTextlocal integer playerIdif DebugNameFilter!="" and DebugNameFilter!=GetUnitName(GetTriggerUnit())thenreturnendifset playerId=GetPlayerId(GetOwningPlayer(GetTriggerUnit()))set messageText="|cffffffa0"+GetUnitName(GetTriggerUnit())+"|r: "+" |cffa0ffff"+OrderId2String(GetIssuedOrderId())+"|r |cffffa0ff("+I2S(GetIssuedOrderId())+")|r "+IntToStringSpaced(PlayerLaneRole[playerId])+BoolToTF(AiSlotBoolFlagG0[128+playerId])if GetTriggerEventId()==EVENT_PLAYER_UNIT_ISSUED_ORDER thenset messageText=messageTextelseif GetTriggerEventId()==EVENT_PLAYER_UNIT_ISSUED_POINT_ORDER thenset messageText=messageText+" ("+I2S(R2I(GetOrderPointX()))+","+I2S(R2I(GetOrderPointY()))+") ["+I2S(GetUnitUserData(AiSurroundTargetUnit[playerId]))+"-"+I2S(GetUnitUserData(AiAssignedUnit[playerId]))+"]"elseif GetTriggerEventId()==EVENT_PLAYER_UNIT_ISSUED_TARGET_ORDER thenset messageText=messageText+" > "+GetUnitName(GetOrderTargetUnit())elseif GetTriggerEventId()==EVENT_PLAYER_UNIT_ISSUED_UNIT_ORDER thenset messageText=messageTextendifcall DisplayTextToPlayer(FirstPlayingUser,0,0,messageText+" |cffa0a0ff"+DebugContextLabel+"|r")endfunctionfunction ToggleOrderSpellCaptureAndListenPlayer takes nothing returns nothinglocal string chatString=GetEventPlayerChatString()if(StringLength(chatString)==4)thenif(IsTriggerEnabled(ToggledTriggerAH4))thencall DisableTrigger(ToggledTriggerAH4)call PrintTimedTextLocal("Order Capture Trigger disabled")elsecall EnableTrigger(ToggledTriggerAH4)call PrintTimedTextLocal("Order Capture Trigger enabled")endifif(IsTriggerEnabled(ManagedTriggerAI4))thencall DisableTrigger(ManagedTriggerAI4)call PrintTimedTextLocal("SpellCast Capture Trigger disabled")elsecall EnableTrigger(ManagedTriggerAI4)call PrintTimedTextLocal("SpellCast Capture Trigger enabled")endifif(IsTriggerEnabled(ToggledTriggerAH4))thencall PrintTimedTextLocal("Listening to |c00ffff00"+PlayerName[ListenedPlayerId]+"|r")endifelseif(not IsTriggerEnabled(ToggledTriggerAH4))thencall EnableTrigger(ToggledTriggerAH4)call PrintTimedTextLocal("Order Capture Trigger enabled")call EnableTrigger(ManagedTriggerAI4)call PrintTimedTextLocal("SpellCast Capture Trigger enabled")endifset ListenedPlayerId=GetPlayerId(PlayerFromSlotIndex(S2I(SubString(chatString,4,StringLength(chatString)))))call PrintTimedTextLocal("Changed listening to |c00ffff00"+PlayerName[ListenedPlayerId]+"|r")endifendfunctionfunction SetUnitNameCaptureFilterCommand takes nothing returns booleanset DebugNameFilter=SubString(GetEventPlayerChatString(),8,255)call DebugPrintGlobal("Filter applied: -"+DebugNameFilter+"-")return falseendfunctionfunction ToggleDebugModeCommand takes nothing returns booleanif(IsDebugMode==false)thenset IsDebugMode=truecall PrintTimedTextLocal("Debug mode enabled")call EnableSharedControlAndOrderCommand(true)if(not FiveSecondTimerStarted)thencall RegisterHostCommandTriggers()endifelseset IsDebugMode=falsecall PrintTimedTextLocal("Debug mode disabled")call EnableSharedControlAndOrderCommand(false)endifreturn falseendfunctionfunction FilterIssuedOrderIs851990 takes nothing returns booleanreturn GetIssuedOrderId()==851990endfunctionfunction BlinkUnitToPointAndKillTrees takes nothing returns nothinglocal unit blinkUnit=GetTriggerUnit()local real destX=GetOrderPointX()local real destY=GetOrderPointY()call IssueImmediateOrderById(blinkUnit,851972)call SetUnitAnimation(blinkUnit,"spell")call DestroyEffect(AddSpecialEffect("Abilities\\Spells\\NightElf\\Blink\\BlinkTarget.mdl",GetUnitX(blinkUnit),GetUnitY(blinkUnit)))call TriggerSleepAction(.05)call DestroyEffect(AddSpecialEffectTarget("Abilities\\Spells\\NightElf\\Blink\\BlinkCaster.mdl",blinkUnit,"origin"))call TriggerSleepAction(.1)call KillTreesInArea(destX,destY,130)call SetUnitX(blinkUnit,destX)call SetUnitY(blinkUnit,destY)endfunctionfunction ToggleInstantJumpCommand takes nothing returns nothingif IsTriggerEnabled(BlinkOrderTrigger)==false thencall EnableTrigger(BlinkOrderTrigger)call PrintTimedTextLocal("Instant Jump is enabled")elsecall DisableTrigger(BlinkOrderTrigger)call PrintTimedTextLocal("Instant Jump is disabled")endifendfunctionfunction FilterPrintUnitMoveSpeed takes nothing returns booleancall DisplayTimedTextToPlayer(CommandPlayer,0,MessageDisplayY,10.,PlayerColorCode[GetPlayerId(GetOwningPlayer(GetFilterUnit()))]+GetObjectName(GetUnitTypeId(GetFilterUnit()))+"|r movespeed is "+I2S(R2I(.5+GetUnitMoveSpeed(GetFilterUnit()))))return falseendfunctionfunction EnumSetUnitMoveSpeed takes nothing returns booleanif CommandValue>0 thencall SetUnitMoveSpeed(GetFilterUnit(),CommandValue)elsecall SetUnitMoveSpeed(GetFilterUnit(),GetUnitDefaultMoveSpeed(GetFilterUnit()))endifreturn falseendfunctionfunction EnumKillUnit_2 takes nothing returns booleancall KillUnit(GetFilterUnit())return falseendfunctionfunction EnumRemoveUnit_2 takes nothing returns booleancall RemoveUnit(GetFilterUnit())return falseendfunctionfunction EnumRefreshUnit takes nothing returns booleanlocal unit u=GetFilterUnit()call UnitResetCooldown(u)call SetUnitState(u,UNIT_STATE_LIFE,GetUnitState(u,UNIT_STATE_MAX_LIFE))call SetUnitState(u,UNIT_STATE_MANA,GetUnitState(u,UNIT_STATE_MAX_MANA))if u==TrackedSideUnit[GetPlayerId(GetOwningPlayer(u))]thencall TimerStart(PlayerAbilityCooldownTimer[GetPlayerId(GetOwningPlayer(u))],0,false,null)endifreturn falseendfunctionfunction EnumSetUnitLife takes nothing returns booleanif GetWidgetLife(GetFilterUnit())>.405 thencall SetUnitState(GetFilterUnit(),UNIT_STATE_LIFE,RMaxBJ(.5,CommandValue))endifreturn falseendfunctionfunction EnumSetUnitMana takes nothing returns booleancall SetUnitState(GetFilterUnit(),UNIT_STATE_MANA,RMaxBJ(0,CommandValue))return falseendfunctionfunction EnumSetUnitOwner takes nothing returns booleancall SetUnitOwner(GetFilterUnit(),Player(CommandValue),true)return falseendfunctionfunction SetSelectedUnitsOwner takes integer i returns nothingif i<0 or i>15 thencall DisplayTimedTextToPlayer(CommandPlayer,0,0,10.,"Incorrect owner. Should be 0-15")returnelseset CommandValue=iendifcall GroupEnumUnitsSelected(SelectedUnitsGroup,CommandPlayer,Filter(function EnumSetUnitOwner))endfunctionfunction EnumToggleUnitPause takes nothing returns booleancall PauseUnit(GetFilterUnit(),(not IsUnitPaused(GetFilterUnit())))return falseendfunctionfunction ResolveCommandTargetPlayer takes integer playerIndex returns playerlocal player targetPlayer=nulllocal unit selectedUnit=nullif playerIndex==(-20164)thencall GroupEnumUnitsSelected(SelectedUnitsGroup,CommandPlayer,Filter(function FilterAlwaysTrue))set selectedUnit=FirstOfGroup(SelectedUnitsGroup)if selectedUnit!=null thenset targetPlayer=GetOwningPlayer(selectedUnit)endifcall GroupClear(SelectedUnitsGroup)set selectedUnit=nullelseif playerIndex<0 or playerIndex>15 thencall DisplayTimedTextToPlayer(CommandPlayer,0,0,10.,"Incorrect player. Should be 0-15")elseset targetPlayer=Player(playerIndex)endifif targetPlayer==CommandPlayer thenset targetPlayer=nullendifreturn targetPlayerendfunctionfunction ToggleSharedControlWithPlayer takes integer commandIndex returns nothinglocal player targetPlayer=ResolveCommandTargetPlayer(commandIndex)if targetPlayer!=null thencall SetPlayerAlliance(targetPlayer,CommandPlayer,ALLIANCE_SHARED_CONTROL,(not(GetPlayerAlliance(targetPlayer,CommandPlayer,ALLIANCE_SHARED_CONTROL))))endifendfunctionfunction ToggleSharedVisionWithPlayer takes integer commandIndex returns nothinglocal player targetPlayer=ResolveCommandTargetPlayer(commandIndex)if targetPlayer!=null thencall SetPlayerAlliance(targetPlayer,CommandPlayer,ALLIANCE_SHARED_VISION,(not(GetPlayerAlliance(targetPlayer,CommandPlayer,ALLIANCE_SHARED_VISION))))if GetPlayerAlliance(targetPlayer,CommandPlayer,ALLIANCE_SHARED_VISION)thencall DisplayTimedTextToPlayer(CommandPlayer,0,0,10.,PlayerColorCode[GetPlayerId(targetPlayer)]+GetPlayerName(targetPlayer)+"|r |c00e4cd5ahas shared vision with you|r")elsecall DisplayTimedTextToPlayer(CommandPlayer,0,0,10.,"|c00e4cd5aShared vision from|r "+PlayerColorCode[GetPlayerId(targetPlayer)]+GetPlayerName(targetPlayer)+"|r |c00e4cd5ahas been taken away|r")endifendifendfunctionfunction CaptureSelectedUnitPosition takes nothing returns nothinglocal unit u=nullcall GroupEnumUnitsSelected(SelectedUnitsGroup,CommandPlayer,Filter(function FilterAlwaysTrue))set u=FirstOfGroup(SelectedUnitsGroup)set CommandValue=R2I(GetUnitX(u))set ScratchInteger_2=R2I(GetUnitY(u))call GroupClear(SelectedUnitsGroup)set u=nullendfunctionfunction SpawnRuneAtLocation takes string locationCode,integer runeType returns nothinglocal real spawnXlocal real spawnYset TempCreatedItem=nullif locationCode=="t" thenset spawnX=GetLocationX(TempLocationA)set spawnY=GetLocationY(TempLocationA)call EnumItemsInRect(RuneSpawnRectTop,Condition(function FilterAlwaysTrue),function EnumFindLiveRuneItem)elseif locationCode=="b" thenset spawnX=GetLocationX(TempLocationB)set spawnY=GetLocationY(TempLocationB)call EnumItemsInRect(RuneSpawnRectBottom,Condition(function FilterAlwaysTrue),function EnumFindLiveRuneItem)elseif locationCode=="h" thencall CaptureSelectedUnitPosition()set spawnX=CommandValueset spawnY=ScratchInteger_2elseif locationCode=="a" thencall SpawnRuneAtLocation("t",runeType)call SpawnRuneAtLocation("b",runeType)returnelsereturnendifif TempCreatedItem!=null thenreturnendifif runeType==1 thencall CreateItem('I007',spawnX,spawnY)elseif runeType==2 thencall CreateItem('I008',spawnX,spawnY)elseif runeType==3 thencall CreateItem('I00J',spawnX,spawnY)elseif runeType==4 thencall CreateItem('I00K',spawnX,spawnY)elseif runeType==5 thencall CreateItem('I006',spawnX,spawnY)elseif runeType==6 thencall CreateItem('I0RC',spawnX,spawnY)endifendfunctionfunction EnumToggleInvulnerable takes nothing returns booleanif GetUnitAbilityLevel(GetFilterUnit(),'Avul')>0 thencall UnitRemoveAbility(GetFilterUnit(),'Avul')elsecall UnitAddAbility(GetFilterUnit(),'Avul')endifreturn falseendfunctionfunction EnumToggleInvisibility takes nothing returns booleanif GetUnitAbilityLevel(GetFilterUnit(),'A0Z2')==0 thencall UnitAddAbility(GetFilterUnit(),'A0Z2')call SetUnitAbilityLevel(GetFilterUnit(),'A0Z2',3)elsecall UnitRemoveAbility(GetFilterUnit(),'A0Z2')endifreturn falseendfunctionfunction EnumToggleGhost takes nothing returns booleanif GetUnitAbilityLevel(GetFilterUnit(),'Agho')==0 thencall UnitAddAbility(GetFilterUnit(),'Agho')elsecall UnitRemoveAbility(GetFilterUnit(),'Agho')endifreturn falseendfunctionfunction EnumRemoveBuffs takes nothing returns booleancall UnitRemoveBuffs(GetFilterUnit(),true,true)return falseendfunctionfunction ExecuteScCommand takes nothing returns nothingcall ExecuteTriggerJS()endfunctionfunction SpawnSuperCreeps takes nothing returns nothingif FirstWaveSpawnedFlag==false and LaneSpawnDisabledLane1==false thenif(GameModeFlagAv)thencall CreateNUnitsAtLoc(CasterCreepCount,'umtw',ScourgePlayer[0],ScourgeCasterSpawnLaneC,bj_UNIT_FACING)elsecall CreateNUnitsAtLoc(CasterCreepCount,'u00R',ScourgePlayer[0],ScourgeCasterSpawnLaneC,bj_UNIT_FACING)endifcall SetCreepGroupUpgradeLevel(bj_lastCreatedGroup,2)endifif LaneSpawnDisabledLane0==false thenif(Team1Lane0SpawnFlagA)thencall CreateNUnitsAtLoc(CasterCreepCount,'umtw',ScourgePlayer[0],ScourgeCasterSpawnLaneA,bj_UNIT_FACING)elsecall CreateNUnitsAtLoc(CasterCreepCount,'u00R',ScourgePlayer[0],ScourgeCasterSpawnLaneA,bj_UNIT_FACING)endifcall SetCreepGroupUpgradeLevel(bj_lastCreatedGroup,3)endifif FirstWaveSpawnedFlag==false and LaneSpawnDisabledLane2==false thenif(Team1Lane2SpawnFlagB)thencall CreateNUnitsAtLoc(CasterCreepCount,'umtw',ScourgePlayer[0],ScourgeCasterSpawnLaneB,bj_UNIT_FACING)elsecall CreateNUnitsAtLoc(CasterCreepCount,'u00R',ScourgePlayer[0],ScourgeCasterSpawnLaneB,bj_UNIT_FACING)endifcall SetCreepGroupUpgradeLevel(bj_lastCreatedGroup,4)endifif FirstWaveSpawnedFlag==false and LaneSpawnDisabledLane1==false thenif(Team2Lane1SpawnFlagA)thencall CreateNUnitsAtLoc(CasterCreepCount,'ebal',SentinelPlayer[0],SentinelCasterSpawnLaneC,bj_UNIT_FACING)elsecall CreateNUnitsAtLoc(CasterCreepCount,'e026',SentinelPlayer[0],SentinelCasterSpawnLaneC,bj_UNIT_FACING)endifcall SetCreepGroupUpgradeLevel(bj_lastCreatedGroup,2)endifif LaneSpawnDisabledLane0==false thenif(Team2Lane0SpawnFlagA)thencall CreateNUnitsAtLoc(CasterCreepCount,'ebal',SentinelPlayer[0],SentinelCasterSpawnLaneA,bj_UNIT_FACING)elsecall CreateNUnitsAtLoc(CasterCreepCount,'e026',SentinelPlayer[0],SentinelCasterSpawnLaneA,bj_UNIT_FACING)endifcall SetCreepGroupUpgradeLevel(bj_lastCreatedGroup,3)endifif FirstWaveSpawnedFlag==false and LaneSpawnDisabledLane2==false thenif(Team2Lane2SpawnFlagA)thencall CreateNUnitsAtLoc(CasterCreepCount,'ebal',SentinelPlayer[0],SentinelCasterSpawnLaneB,bj_UNIT_FACING)elsecall CreateNUnitsAtLoc(CasterCreepCount,'e026',SentinelPlayer[0],SentinelCasterSpawnLaneB,bj_UNIT_FACING)endifcall SetCreepGroupUpgradeLevel(bj_lastCreatedGroup,4)endifendfunctionfunction EnumCountOwnHero takes nothing returns booleanif(IsUnitType(GetFilterUnit(),UNIT_TYPE_HERO))and(IsUnitIllusion(GetFilterUnit())==false)and(GetOwningPlayer(GetFilterUnit())==CommandPlayer)thenset ScratchInteger_2=ScratchInteger_2+1return trueendifreturn falseendfunctionfunction SetMainSelectedHero takes nothing returns nothingset ScratchInteger_2=0call GroupEnumUnitsSelected(SelectedUnitsGroup,CommandPlayer,Filter(function EnumCountOwnHero))if ScratchInteger_2==0 thencall DisplayTimedTextToPlayer(CommandPlayer,0,0,10.,"You have not selected your own hero.")elseif ScratchInteger_2>1 thencall DisplayTimedTextToPlayer(CommandPlayer,0,0,10.,"More than one hero selected.")elseset TrackedSideUnit[GetPlayerId(CommandPlayer)]=FirstOfGroup(SelectedUnitsGroup)endifcall GroupClear(SelectedUnitsGroup)endfunctionfunction OnAlphaTestChatCommand takes nothing returns nothinglocal string chatString=GetEventPlayerChatString()local string First3=SubString(chatString,0,3)local string prefix4=SubString(chatString,0,4)local string prefix5=SubString(chatString,0,5)local string prefix6=SubString(chatString,0,6)local string prefix7=SubString(chatString,0,7)local string prefix8=SubString(chatString,0,8)local string prefix9=SubString(chatString,0,9)set CommandPlayer=GetTriggerPlayer()if chatString=="-jump" thencall ToggleInstantJumpCommand()elseif chatString=="-kill" thencall GroupEnumUnitsSelected(SelectedUnitsGroup,CommandPlayer,Filter(function EnumKillUnit_2))elseif chatString=="-remove" thencall GroupEnumUnitsSelected(SelectedUnitsGroup,CommandPlayer,Filter(function EnumRemoveUnit_2))elseif chatString=="-refresh" or chatString=="-r" thencall GroupEnumUnitsSelected(SelectedUnitsGroup,CommandPlayer,Filter(function EnumRefreshUnit))elseif chatString=="-ms" thencall GroupEnumUnitsSelected(SelectedUnitsGroup,CommandPlayer,Filter(function FilterPrintUnitMoveSpeed))elseif prefix6=="-setms" thenset CommandValue=S2I(SubString(chatString,6,StringLength(chatString)))call GroupEnumUnitsSelected(SelectedUnitsGroup,CommandPlayer,Filter(function EnumSetUnitMoveSpeed))elseif prefix4=="-hp " thenset CommandValue=S2I(SubString(chatString,4,StringLength(chatString)))call GroupEnumUnitsSelected(SelectedUnitsGroup,CommandPlayer,Filter(function EnumSetUnitLife))elseif prefix4=="-mp " thenset CommandValue=S2I(SubString(chatString,4,StringLength(chatString)))call GroupEnumUnitsSelected(SelectedUnitsGroup,CommandPlayer,Filter(function EnumSetUnitMana))elseif prefix7=="-owner " thencall SetSelectedUnitsOwner(S2I(SubString(chatString,7,StringLength(chatString))))elseif chatString=="-own" thencall SetSelectedUnitsOwner(GetPlayerId(CommandPlayer))elseif prefix9=="-control " thencall ToggleSharedControlWithPlayer(S2I(SubString(chatString,9,StringLength(chatString))))elseif chatString=="-control" thencall ToggleSharedControlWithPlayer(-20164)elseif prefix8=="-vision " thencall ToggleSharedVisionWithPlayer(S2I(SubString(chatString,8,StringLength(chatString))))elseif chatString=="-vision" thencall ToggleSharedVisionWithPlayer(-20164)elseif chatString=="-pause" thencall GroupEnumUnitsSelected(SelectedUnitsGroup,CommandPlayer,Filter(function EnumToggleUnitPause))elseif prefix6=="-rune " thencall SpawnRuneAtLocation(SubString(chatString,6,7),S2I(SubString(chatString,7,StringLength(chatString))))elseif chatString=="-invul" thencall GroupEnumUnitsSelected(SelectedUnitsGroup,CommandPlayer,Filter(function EnumToggleInvulnerable))elseif chatString=="-invi" thencall GroupEnumUnitsSelected(SelectedUnitsGroup,CommandPlayer,Filter(function EnumToggleInvisibility))elseif chatString=="-ghost" thencall GroupEnumUnitsSelected(SelectedUnitsGroup,CommandPlayer,Filter(function EnumToggleGhost))elseif chatString=="-fly" thenelseif chatString=="-debuff" thencall GroupEnumUnitsSelected(SelectedUnitsGroup,CommandPlayer,Filter(function EnumRemoveBuffs))elseif chatString=="-pathon" thenelseif chatString=="-pathoff" thenelseif prefix4=="-sc " thenelseif chatString=="-sc" thencall ExecuteScCommand()elseif prefix4=="-ss " thenelseif chatString=="-ss" thencall SpawnSuperCreeps()elseif prefix5=="-ssc " thenelseif chatString=="-ssc" thenelseif chatString=="-setmain" thencall SetMainSelectedHero()elseif prefix8=="-create " thenelseif prefix6=="-give " thenendifendfunctionfunction InitAlphaTestCommands takes nothing returns booleanlocal trigger chatTriggerlocal integer indexif not ModeToggleFlagB thenset ModeEnabledFlag_2=trueset SelectedUnitsGroup=CreateGroup()set PlayerColorCode[12]="|c0075B260"set PlayerColorCode[13]="|c00E4E48F"set PlayerColorCode[14]="|c00C6A7D5"set PlayerColorCode[15]="|c00BAC9D1"call CreateUnit(Player(15),'uC74',-7311,-6338,270)call CreateUnit(Player(15),'uC74',6148,6531,270)call SetGV4FlagFalse()set chatTrigger=CreateTrigger()call TriggerAddAction(chatTrigger,function OnAlphaTestChatCommand)set BlinkOrderTrigger=CreateTrigger()call TriggerAddCondition(BlinkOrderTrigger,Condition(function FilterIssuedOrderIs851990))call TriggerAddAction(BlinkOrderTrigger,function BlinkUnitToPointAndKillTrees)set CasterCooldownResetTrigger=CreateTrigger()call TriggerAddAction(CasterCooldownResetTrigger,function ScheduleCasterCooldownReset)set index=0loopcall TriggerRegisterPlayerChatEvent(chatTrigger,Player(index),"-",false)call TriggerRegisterPlayerUnitEvent(BlinkOrderTrigger,Player(index),EVENT_PLAYER_UNIT_ISSUED_POINT_ORDER,Filter(function FilterAlwaysTrue))call TriggerRegisterPlayerUnitEvent(CasterCooldownResetTrigger,Player(index),EVENT_PLAYER_UNIT_SPELL_EFFECT,Filter(function FilterAlwaysTrue))set index=index+1exitwhen index==16endloopset chatTrigger=nullcall DisableTrigger(BlinkOrderTrigger)call DisableTrigger(CasterCooldownResetTrigger)call CreateQuestBJ(2,"Alpha test","TRIGSTR_50016","ReplaceableTextures\\CommandButtons\\BTNBookOfSummoning.blp")call CreateQuestBJ(2,"Command list 1","TRIGSTR_50017","ReplaceableTextures\\CommandButtons\\BTNBloodKey.blp")call CreateQuestBJ(2,"Command list 2","TRIGSTR_50018","ReplaceableTextures\\CommandButtons\\BTNSunKey.blp")call CreateQuestBJ(2,"Command list 3","TRIGSTR_50019","ReplaceableTextures\\CommandButtons\\BTNMoonKey.blp")call PrintTimedTextLocal("Alpha test commands are enabled. See |c00f1ea18Quest|r for more detail.")endifcall RecycleExpiringTrigger(GetTriggeringTrigger())return falseendfunctionfunction FilterNonLocustUnit takes nothing returns booleanreturn GetUnitAbilityLevel(GetFilterUnit(),'Aloc')==0endfunctionfunction FilterNotIllusion takes nothing returns booleanreturn not IsUnitIllusion(GetFilterUnit())endfunctionfunction FilterAlwaysTrue_3 takes nothing returns booleanreturn trueendfunctionfunction IsOnKeywordString takes string inputString returns booleanreturn(inputString==OnKeyword)endfunctionfunction GetPlayerColorCodeString takes player whichPlayer returns stringlocal integer playerId=GetPlayerId(whichPlayer)if playerId>=12 thenreturn NeutralPlayerLabelelseif playerId<=5 thenreturn HeroPlayerNumberLabel+I2S(playerId)elsereturn HeroPlayerNumberLabel+I2S(playerId-1)endifendifendfunctionfunction AddPermanentAbilityToSelectedUnit takes integer abilityId,integer abilityLevel,boolean makePermanent returns nothinglocal integer playerId=GetPlayerId(GetTriggerPlayer())call UnitAddAbility(PlayerHero_3[playerId],abilityId)call SetUnitAbilityLevel(PlayerHero_3[playerId],abilityId,abilityLevel)call UnitMakeAbilityPermanent(PlayerHero_3[playerId],makePermanent,abilityId)endfunctionfunction AddHeroPrimaryStatByIndex takes unit heroUnit,integer statIndex,integer statAmount returns nothingif IsUnitType(heroUnit,UNIT_TYPE_HERO) thenif statIndex==0 thencall SetHeroStr(heroUnit,GetHeroStr(heroUnit,false)+statAmount,true)elseif statIndex==1 thencall SetHeroAgi(heroUnit,GetHeroAgi(heroUnit,false)+statAmount,true)elseif statIndex==2 thencall SetHeroInt(heroUnit,GetHeroInt(heroUnit,false)+statAmount,true)endifendifendfunctionfunction RecordHeroLearnedSkill takes nothing returns nothinglocal unit learningUnit=GetTriggerUnit()local string unitName=GetUnitName(learningUnit)local integer learnedSkillId=GetLearnedSkill()local integer nameHash=StringHash(unitName)local string spellListSeedif GetUnitAbilityLevel(learningUnit,learnedSkillId)==1 and(not IsUnitIllusion(learningUnit))and LoadInteger(AbilityInfoHashtable,nameHash,learnedSkillId)!=1 thencall SaveInteger(AbilityInfoHashtable,nameHash,'name',GetUnitTypeId(learningUnit))set spellListSeed=LoadStr(AbilityInfoHashtable,nameHash,AbilityListStringKey)if spellListSeed==null thenset spellListSeed=""endifcall SaveStr(AbilityInfoHashtable,nameHash,AbilityListStringKey,spellListSeed+DebugDoubleSpaceSep+"|c00ED6C03"+GetObjectName(learnedSkillId)+"|r"+DebugDoubleSpaceSep+DecodeIdToString(learnedSkillId)+DebugObjectIdSuffix)call SaveInteger(AbilityInfoHashtable,nameHash,learnedSkillId,1)endifset learningUnit=nullendfunctionfunction StoreTriggerPlayerSelectedUnit takes nothing returns nothinglocal integer id=GetPlayerId(GetTriggerPlayer())set PlayerHero_3[id]=GetTriggerUnit()endfunctionfunction RegisterSelectionStoreAction takes nothing returns nothingcall TriggerAddAction(UnitSelectedTrigger,function StoreTriggerPlayerSelectedUnit)endfunctionfunction RegisterSkillLearnRecordAction takes nothing returns nothingcall TriggerAddAction(HeroSkillLearnedTrigger,function RecordHeroLearnedSkill)endfunctionfunction GetPlayerByIdClamped takes integer id returns playerif id>15 or id<0 thenreturn Player(0)endifreturn Player(id)endfunctionfunction ShowDamageDebugMessage takes nothing returns nothingif PlayerLocalToggleB_2[GetPlayerId(GetLocalPlayer())]thencall DisplayTimedTextToPlayer(GetLocalPlayer(),0,0,10,DebugDamageSourceLabel+GetUnitName(GetEventDamageSource())+DebugDamageTargetLabel+GetUnitName(GetTriggerUnit())+DebugDamageValueLabel+R2S(GetEventDamage()))endifendfunctionfunction RegisterAllUnitsDamageDebug takes nothing returns nothinglocal group enumGroup=CreateGroup()local unit enumUnit=nullcall GroupEnumUnitsInRect(enumGroup,GetWorldBounds(),Condition(function FilterNonLocustUnit))set enumUnit=FirstOfGroup(enumGroup)loopexitwhen enumUnit==nullcall TriggerRegisterUnitEvent(DamageDebugTrigger,enumUnit,EVENT_UNIT_DAMAGED)call GroupRemoveUnit(enumGroup,enumUnit)set enumUnit=FirstOfGroup(enumGroup)endloopcall DestroyGroup(enumGroup)set enumUnit=nullset enumGroup=nullcall TriggerAddAction(DamageDebugTrigger,function ShowDamageDebugMessage)endfunctionfunction HandleCheatChatCommand takes nothing returns nothinglocal string chatString=GetEventPlayerChatString()local integer chatLength=StringLength(chatString)local string argString=nulllocal string tempString=nulllocal integer intArg=0local integer intArg2=0local real realArg=0local integer nameHashlocal string matchedCommand=GetEventPlayerChatStringMatched()local integer playerId=GetPlayerId(GetTriggerPlayer())local item tempItem=nullif matchedCommand==CmdSearch thenset argString=SubString(chatString,8,chatLength)set nameHash=StringHash(argString)set argString=LoadStr(AbilityInfoHashtable,nameHash,AbilityListStringKey)if argString==null thenset argString=""endifcall DisplayTimedTextToPlayer(GetTriggerPlayer(),0,0,13,DebugObjectIdLabel+DecodeIdToString(LoadInteger(AbilityInfoHashtable,nameHash,'name')))call DisplayTimedTextToPlayer(GetTriggerPlayer(),0,0,13,DebugSpellListLabel+argString)elseif matchedCommand==CmdDebug thenset argString=SubString(chatString,7,chatLength)set PlayerLocalToggleA_2[playerId]=IsOnKeywordString(argString)elseif matchedCommand==CmdLock thenset argString=SubString(chatString,6,chatLength)elseif matchedCommand==CmdSpellMsg thenset argString=SubString(chatString,10,chatLength)set PlayerTestFeatureEnabled[playerId]=IsOnKeywordString(argString)elseif matchedCommand==CmdDmgDbg thenset argString=SubString(chatString,8,chatLength)set PlayerLocalToggleB_2[playerId]=IsOnKeywordString(argString)set DamageDebugRegistrationArmed=trueif RunOnceFlag thencall RegisterAllUnitsDamageDebug()set RunOnceFlag=falseendifelseif matchedCommand==CmdStat thenset intArg=S2I(SubString(chatString,6,7))set intArg2=S2I(SubString(chatString,8,chatLength))call AddHeroPrimaryStatByIndex(PlayerHero_3[playerId],intArg,intArg2)elseif matchedCommand==CmdInvul thenset argString=SubString(chatString,7,chatLength)call SetUnitInvulnerable(PlayerHero_3[playerId],IsOnKeywordString(argString))elseif matchedCommand==CmdRatio thenset realArg=S2R(SubString(chatString,7,chatLength))call SetUnitTimeScale(PlayerHero_3[playerId],realArg)elseif matchedCommand==CmdShare thenset intArg2=9loopexitwhen intArg2==chatLength-1if SubString(chatString,intArg2,intArg2+1)=="o" thenexitwhen trueendifset intArg2=intArg2+1endloopset argString=SubString(chatString,intArg2,chatLength)set intArg=S2I(SubString(chatString,7,9))call SetPlayerAlliance(GetPlayerByIdClamped(intArg),Player(playerId),ALLIANCE_SHARED_CONTROL,IsOnKeywordString(argString))elseif matchedCommand==CmdGet thenset intArg=S2I(SubString(chatString,5,chatLength))call SetUnitOwner(PlayerHero_3[playerId],GetPlayerByIdClamped(intArg),true)elseif matchedCommand==CmdCharge thenset intArg=S2I(SubString(chatString,8,9))set intArg2=S2I(SubString(chatString,10,chatLength))call SetItemCharges(UnitItemInSlot(PlayerHero_3[playerId],intArg),intArg2)elseif matchedCommand==CmdItem thenset intArg=EncodeStringToId(SubString(chatString,6,chatLength))set tempItem=CreateItem(intArg,GetUnitX(PlayerHero_3[playerId]),GetUnitY(PlayerHero_3[playerId]))call SetItemPlayer(tempItem,GetOwningPlayer(PlayerHero_3[playerId]),false)call UnitAddItem(PlayerHero_3[playerId],tempItem)set tempItem=nullelseif matchedCommand==CmdDesItem thenset intArg=S2I(SubString(chatString,9,10))set argString=SubString(chatString,11,chatLength)set tempItem=UnitRemoveItemFromSlot(PlayerHero_3[playerId],intArg)if IsOnKeywordString(argString)thencall SetWidgetLife(tempItem,.5)call RemoveItem(tempItem)set tempItem=nullendifelseif matchedCommand==CmdDrop thenset intArg=S2I(SubString(chatString,6,7))set argString=SubString(chatString,8,chatLength)call SetItemDroppable(UnitItemInSlot(PlayerHero_3[playerId],intArg),IsOnKeywordString(argString))elseif matchedCommand==CmdSpell thenset intArg=EncodeStringToId(SubString(chatString,7,11))set intArg2=S2I(SubString(chatString,12,StringLength(chatString)))call AddPermanentAbilityToSelectedUnit(intArg,intArg2,true)elseif matchedCommand==CmdDespell thenset intArg=EncodeStringToId(SubString(chatString,9,chatLength))call UnitRemoveAbility(PlayerHero_3[playerId],intArg)elseif matchedCommand==CmdDecease thenset intArg=S2I(SubString(chatString,9,chatLength))if intArg==1 thencall KillUnit(PlayerHero_3[playerId])elsecall RemoveUnit(PlayerHero_3[playerId])endifelseif matchedCommand==CmdBangBang thenset intArg=EncodeStringToId(SubString(chatString,3,chatLength))call CreateUnit(GetOwningPlayer(PlayerHero_3[playerId]),intArg,GetUnitX(PlayerHero_3[playerId]),GetUnitY(PlayerHero_3[playerId]),0)elseif matchedCommand==CmdText thenset argString=DecodeIdToString(GetUnitTypeId(PlayerHero_3[playerId]))set intArg=S2I(SubString(chatString,6,chatLength))set tempItem=UnitItemInSlot(PlayerHero_3[playerId],intArg)call DisplayTimedTextToPlayer(GetTriggerPlayer(),0,0,5,DebugNameLabel+(GetUnitName(PlayerHero_3[playerId])))call DisplayTimedTextToPlayer(GetTriggerPlayer(),0,0,5,DebugObjectIdLabel+argString)call DisplayTimedTextToPlayer(GetTriggerPlayer(),0,0,5,GetItemName(tempItem)+DebugDoubleSpaceSep+DecodeIdToString(GetItemTypeId(tempItem)))call DisplayTimedTextToPlayer(GetTriggerPlayer(),0,0,5,"x: "+R2S(GetUnitX(PlayerHero_3[playerId]))+" y: "+R2S(GetUnitY(PlayerHero_3[playerId])))set tempItem=nullelseif matchedCommand==CmdEnable thenset intArg=EncodeStringToId(SubString(chatString,8,chatLength))call SetPlayerAbilityAvailable(GetOwningPlayer(PlayerHero_3[playerId]),intArg,true)elseif matchedCommand==CmdDisable thenset intArg=EncodeStringToId(SubString(chatString,9,chatLength))call SetPlayerAbilityAvailable(GetOwningPlayer(PlayerHero_3[playerId]),intArg,false)endifendfunctionfunction ShowUnitCastDebugMessage takes nothing returns nothinglocal unit casterUnit=GetTriggerUnit()local integer spellId=GetSpellAbilityId()local integer lastOrderId=LoadInteger(AbilityInfoHashtable,GetHandleId(casterUnit),'cast')call DisplayTimedTextToPlayer(GetLocalPlayer(),0,0,12,DebugCasterLabel+GetUnitName(casterUnit)+DebugUnitTypeIdLabel+DecodeIdToString(GetUnitTypeId(casterUnit))+DebugOwningPlayerLabel+GetPlayerColorCodeString(GetTriggerPlayer()))call DisplayTimedTextToPlayer(GetLocalPlayer(),0,0,12,DebugSpellNameLabel+GetObjectName(spellId)+DebugSpellAbilityIdLabel+DecodeIdToString(spellId)+DebugLastOrderStringLabel+"|c00fffc01 "+OrderId2String(lastOrderId)+"|r"+DebugOrderIdLabel+I2S(lastOrderId))set casterUnit=nullendfunctionfunction HandleSpellCastDebug takes nothing returns nothinglocal unit castingUnit=GetTriggerUnit()local integer unitId=GetHandleId(castingUnit)local integer currentOrder=GetUnitCurrentOrder(castingUnit)local integer abilityId=GetSpellAbilityId()if currentOrder!=0 thencall SaveInteger(AbilityInfoHashtable,unitId,'cast',currentOrder)endifif abilityId!=0 thenif PlayerTestFeatureEnabled[GetPlayerId(GetLocalPlayer())]thencall ShowUnitCastDebugMessage()endifendifcall RemoveSavedInteger(AbilityInfoHashtable,unitId,'cast')set castingUnit=nullendfunctionfunction ShowUnitSelectDebugMessage takes nothing returns nothinglocal unit u=GetTriggerUnit()call DisplayTimedTextToPlayer(GetLocalPlayer(),0,0,20,DebugSpawnedUnitNameLabel+GetUnitName(u)+DebugUnitTypeIdLabel+DecodeIdToString(GetUnitTypeId(u))+DebugOwningPlayerLabel+GetPlayerColorCodeString(GetTriggerPlayer()))set u=nullendfunctionfunction OnUnitEnterRegionRegisterDamage takes nothing returns nothinglocal unit enteringUnit=GetTriggerUnit()local integer nameHash=StringHash(GetUnitName(enteringUnit))if not HaveSavedInteger(AbilityInfoHashtable,nameHash,'name')thencall SaveInteger(AbilityInfoHashtable,nameHash,'name',GetUnitTypeId(enteringUnit))endifif PlayerLocalToggleA_2[GetPlayerId(GetLocalPlayer())] thencall ShowUnitSelectDebugMessage()endifif DamageDebugRegistrationArmed and GetUnitAbilityLevel(enteringUnit,'Aloc')==0 and(not IsUnitIllusion(enteringUnit))and GetOwningPlayer(enteringUnit)!=Player(0)and GetOwningPlayer(enteringUnit)!=Player(6)thencall TriggerRegisterUnitEvent(DamageDebugTrigger,enteringUnit,EVENT_UNIT_DAMAGED)endifset enteringUnit=nullendfunctionfunction InitWorldBoundsRegion takes nothing returns nothingset WorldBoundsRegion=CreateRegion()call RegionAddRect(WorldBoundsRegion,GetWorldBounds())endfunctionfunction RegisterEnterWorldRegionAction takes trigger whichTrigger,code actionFunc returns nothingcall TriggerRegisterEnterRegion(whichTrigger,WorldBoundsRegion,Condition(function FilterAlwaysTrue_3))call TriggerAddAction(whichTrigger,actionFunc)endfunctionfunction RegisterSpellCastDebugAction takes nothing returns nothingcall TriggerAddAction(SpellCastDebugTrigger,function HandleSpellCastDebug)endfunctionfunction InitCheatCommandSystem takes nothing returns nothinglocal integer i=0call InitWorldBoundsRegion()loopexitwhen i>15call TriggerRegisterPlayerUnitEvent(UnitSelectedTrigger,Player(i),EVENT_PLAYER_UNIT_SELECTED,Condition(function FilterAlwaysTrue_3))call TriggerRegisterPlayerUnitEvent(HeroSkillLearnedTrigger,Player(i),EVENT_PLAYER_HERO_SKILL,Condition(function F